menu "MultiGeiger"

    config GEIGER_LORAWAN
        bool "LoRaWAN uplink support (Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V4 only)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles main/lorawan.cpp and pulls the jgromes/radiolib
            managed component. Set ONLY by
            sdkconfig.defaults.heltec_wifi_lora32_v4_r2 — the SX1262 is
            module-internal wiring on that board. Other boards must keep
            this off; the ringfence guarantee is that no RadioLib code
            links into their binaries.

endmenu
